=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Laila} at (G-7) in {z:Upper Jeuno} to begin the quest.
** {p:Home Point} #1 in {z:Upper Jeuno} is close by.
** You must choose **"I surely do."** and then **"Never!"** to continue.
* She will then ask for a {@k} {k:Stardust pebble}.
* Speak with the mithran dancer {n:Rhea Myuliah} next to her.
** If you speak to {n:Laila} and {n:Rhea Myuliah} answers, continue on to the next step.
* Head to **Lion Springs Tavern** at (K-6) in {z:Southern San d'Oria} and speak to {n:Valderotaux} at the bar to "dance" and underwhelm him.
** {p:Home Point} #3 in {z:Southern San d'Oria} is near the Tavern.
** You can select any of the options while on stage, the results are the same.
* Return to {n:Rhea Myuliah} in {z:Upper Jeuno} to discover what the pebbles are. She'll also reveal they used to lay at the bottom of {p:Lake Mechieume} in {z:Jugner Forest} twenty years ago.
* Travel to the past and go to (I-5) in {z:Jugner Forest (S)}.
** It is relatively close to the {z:Batallia Downs (S)} zone line. You can travel via the {p:Survival Guide} there or through the {p:Cavernous Maw}.
** You could also travel via {s:Recall-Jugner} if you have that option available.
* Touch the **glowing pebbles** targetable location near the shore for a cutscene and to receive the {@k} {k:Stardust pebble}.
** **Note:** This spot is not actually glowing, unlike other targetable locations in the game. It is simply a targetable spot in the environment. Target around at (I-5) and pay attention to your target names in order to find the spot.
* Speak with {n:Laila} in {z:Upper Jeuno} once more to finish the quest.

